7. Hotel Billing System

Create a hotel billing program.

Input:

Customer Name
Room Price
Number of Days
Food Bill
AC Room (True/False)

Calculate:

Room Cost = Room Price × Number of Days
Total Bill = Room Cost + Food Bill

Rules:

Stay ≥ 5 days → 10% discount
AC room → add ₹500 per day
Total bill ≥ ₹10,000 → additional 5% discount

Display:

Customer Name
Room Cost
Food Bill
Discount
Final Bill
